	(359, 12, 25, 'Day 22', '🎤 Sprint Day 2 — Capstone Presentations', '{"Day": "Day 22", "Week": "🏁 Capstone Sprint (Integration & Demo)", "Hands-On": "Each team presents to the panel; demo runs live without slides for the core flow; retrospective board completed in Jira", "Subtopics": "Morning: Final preparation window (30 min)\nPresentation slots per team:\n  • Architecture walkthrough (tech stack, design decisions)\n  • Live demo of end-to-end solution\n  • Code walkthrough (key modules, CI/CD pipeline)\n  • Q&A from panel (instructors + peers)\nAfternoon: Sprint Retrospective in Jira — What went well? What to improve? Learnings logged", "Learning Outcome": "Communicate technical work clearly to a mixed audience; reflect on the sprint process; receive structured evaluative feedback", "Topic / Activity": "🎤 Sprint Day 2 — Capstone Presentations", "Assessment & Engagement": "🥇 Best Project Award\n🎤 Retrospective presented to cohort"}'),
